<title>ARGENTINA: Ecuador names Sotomayor industry minister.</title>
<headline>Ecuador names Sotomayor industry minister.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ecuadorean government has named Benigno Sotomayor, the head of the electric firm Electroquito, as the new industry minister, a presidential spokesman said Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The industrialist Sotomayor will be sworn in at 18:00 (2300 GMT),&quot; the spokesman told reporters.  </p>
<p>He previously was president of the Ecuador Industrial Federation and has a long history of experience in the electricity and beer industries.</p>
<p>((--Gustavo Oviedo, Quito newsroom, 5932 258 429))</p>
